ff)\n        };\n\n        if found {\n            let mut stdout = std::io::stdout();\n            let prefix = format!(\"Line {}, Column {}: \", token.line, token.column);\n            let _ = stdout.write_all(prefix.as_bytes());\n            let _ = stdout.write_all(haystack);\n            let _ = stdout.write_all(b\"\\n\");\n            count += 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    print!(\"Found {} occurrences\\n\", count);\n}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
